HB0088 Multi-family dwelling single stairwell exits.
Sponsored By: Joint Appropriations Committee
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; requiring counties, cities and
towns to allow single exits in specified multi-family dwellings; providing
exceptions; and providing for an effective date.
12/30/2024 Bill Number Assigned
